WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.740
Oh, a shooting star.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.610
The stars are pretty today.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.160
The Earth has been targeted.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.170
My name is Eiji.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.790
Not Bandou Eiji, if that's 
what you're thinking.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.010
Bandou?

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.100
You know? Bandou.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.130
Anyway, the Earth has been targeted.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.390
I came here to tell you that.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.850
Don't move!

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.160
Are you from the USSR? The USA?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.550
What's your mission?

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.950
Why did you come to talk to us?!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.610
I, uh... came from the planet Gradol...

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.350
You know... Gravure Idol?

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.900
Don't like swimsuits, though.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.400
Stop with your nonsense!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.310
<i>That day, we all started 
to think strangely</i>

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.890
<i>after the shock from</i>

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:05.280
<i>Todayama's sister surprising 
us by dropping in.</i>

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.660
Alarm message.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.710
Alarm message.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.490
I'm not letting you get away!

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.820
Rei, we need to launch immediately!

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:21.600
Ready.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.790
Do you know about 
Todayama's sister coming

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.050
to the Astronomy Club the other day?

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:26.010
It seemed like something was going on.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.710
As our club's advisor,

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.020
what do you think is best 
to do, Oomori-sensei?

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.970
You're so cute... Oomori-sensei.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.590
Oh, Oomori-sensei!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.120
Not under the skirt...

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.790
Oomori-sensei, you can't do this...

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.510
You can't...

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.660
What are you doing, Hiromatsu?

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:05.800
Oh...

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.120
I didn't know you were into that.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.560
No, she just happened to...

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.370
You don't have to hide it!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.790
There's a lot of doujinshi like that,

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.070
so if you want to take a 
peak, just ask me any—

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.270
I'm good.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.570
But now that I know your weak point,

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.160
I can't help but poke said weak point!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.760
Wait! I'm holding onto her.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.490
What?

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.520
I can't let someone who 
was just so indecent out

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.410
in the open like that 
touch Oomori-sensei!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.220
But...

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.940
Yeah, I'm not going to let 
you touch her so easily.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:49.180
I won't get to have fun 
teasing you, otherwise.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:54.030
I love watching them squirm!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:00.490
I can't... wait any longer...

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.170
Hey! What are you trying 
to do to Oomori-sensei?!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.650
You need to be punished 
for your bad behavior!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.660
Oomori-sensei, stop it...

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.080
That tickles...

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.580
S-Stop, Sensei...

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.940
Stop...

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.440
Wh-What are you doing, Oomori-sensei?!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:34.730
Don't do anything bad to my bag!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:39.560
Um, please just move 
away from there slowly...

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.610
That's right... Just like that.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:52.450
Hey, Oomori-sensei! Don't pee there!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:55.150
Oomori-sensei is cute, so you 
can forgive her for the pee.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.410
No, I can't!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.170
Hey, Sensei! You come here!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.500
Oomori-sensei!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.240
Wait!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.050
They can totally hear you down there.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:09.680
<b>Stamp 2012</b>

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.300
Oomori-sensei...

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:27.650
Wait.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.010
If you want entry privileges 
for the Astronomy Club,

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.330
you should get our advisor's permission.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.290
<b>Todayama Izumiko has been granted 
entry privileges for the Astronomy Club. 
-Oomori-sensei</b>

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.290
Granted entry privileges 
for the Astronomy Club?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.830
Is this going to be useful in any way?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.530
Since Oomori-sensei's seal 
is on the document,

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.120
I don't see how Todayama could 
give you any grief over it.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.370
Seal...

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.340
Here you go.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.990
Thank you.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.290
There is one thing I 
would like to ask you.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.390
What is it?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:03.070
What really happened between 
you and your sister?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:09.190
I don't think I'll hear the 
truth from Todayama, you see?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.340
It's easier for me to 
just ask you instead.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.450
Nothing really.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:17.580
I don't know what happened, either.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.580
My sister just changed all of a sudden.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.080
That's all there is to it.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.720
Todayama's a mystery, isn't she?

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.850
You could say one of the reasons 
I joined the Astronomy Club

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:29.470
in the first place was because I 
was kind of interested in her.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:30.630
What?

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.210
You wouldn't expect 
it from watching her,

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.970
but she's researching Astronomy at a
pretty high level when no one's looking.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:38.450
I'm sure there's a reason for it.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.000
No matter what you say to me about her,

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.130
I won't change my opinion about her.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.830
She demeaned Todayama...

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.980
and with her muddied blood... 
I have no intention of forgiving her.

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:48.110
How about just making up with her?

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.320
Wh-What are you...

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.750
I want to avoid any fights in the club.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:55.620
It would cause problems 
for Oomori-sensei.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.670
I can't. It's too late.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.580
I'll tell you your fortune.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:05.810
Um...

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.270
The Moon Reversed.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.560
A freeing of feelings of unease 
that have become chaotic.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:17.720
In the near future, all doubts 
that you have shall be solved.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.150
And if you so desire,

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.100
your interpersonal relationships 
that were causing you

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.020
disillusionment should also 
receive a ray of sunshine.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.620
That's not what I want!

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.450
I don't want to reconcile 
things with her.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.410
Half of your blood is Todayama blood.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.500
If you'll excuse me.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.820
What happened?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:16.770
Don't let anyone outside of the

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:19.190
student council know 
about what happened here.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.770
I don't want any of the students
to worry more than they have to.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:23.950
Understood.

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.630
Prez, don't you think it's better that we

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.390
come up with a plan as soon as possible?

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.190
Yes, I already know.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:31.710
Huh?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.780
C-Cats?!

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.310
What happened to the Prez?

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.060
She's not good with cats.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.060
Yeah, but the way she 
got scared just now...

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.310
<b>Student Council</b>

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:48.310
What's wrong? 
You're sure sweating a lot.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.360
There was a cat...

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.360
Oh? You're still afraid 
of cats, are you?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.820
Th-That doesn't matter!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.320
Now fess up.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.740
What are you talking about?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.540
The Astronomy Club is involved with the

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.020
recent string of girls losing

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.660
consciousness on school 
grounds, aren't they?!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.050
Of course not...

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:08.670
You can't fool me.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.740
The Astronomy Club, 
given how weird it is,

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:13.540
has to be involved.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.860
We have nothing to do with it.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.850
Do you have proof?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.050
Proof...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.510
All right. You're totally 
getting shut down.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.530
That's not good...

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:31.520
So if we can figure out 
who's behind this case,

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.570
Um...

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.020
you'll rescind the order 
to shut down the club?

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:40.760
Don't say that, Hasumi...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.750
<b>How's Oomori-sensei (the person) today?</b>

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:50.750
How's Oomori-sensei (the person) today?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.290
<b>Staff Bathroom</b>

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.120
I can't believe I'm getting so

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.550
excited just 'cause I'm 
going to see my boyfriend.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:02.760
Oomori-sensei's really 
weird, isn't she?

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:06.340
Yeah, she peed in the hallway...

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.970
There's people who've heard screams

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.470
of girls who were assaulted by her...

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.540
She's so scary...

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:23.240
So basically, if we don't figure 
out what's going on here...

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.560
The club will be shut down?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.540
That can't be...

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.280
All right.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:32.220
So when do we have 
to give them the suspect?

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:33.690
By the end of today...

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:34.920
The end of today?!

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.540
Sounds good to me.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.180
We'll have the suspect seeing 
stars around their head.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.510
I don't think that's what they wanted.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.240
All right. We don't have much time.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.140
Let's split up and start the search.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.140
She ignored me..

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.850
Using only words to talk 
to her is pointless...

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.940
<b>Scene of the Crime</b>

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.990
So this is the scene of the crime...

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.430
Huh? What are you doing?

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.940
Todayama-senpai told me to do this...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.940
She's disguising herself 
and doing a stakeout.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.100
Is there any reason for that?

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:02.820
There is.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:13.120
<i>This smell... It has to be...</i>

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.490
All right. We're going 
to do some interviews.

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.640
Noya, make sure you keep watch.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.810
R-Right! Got it!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.640
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.640
Do you remember anything?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.480
No... The next thing I realized 
I was lying in this bed.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.140
I see...

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.770
Thank you for helping us out.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.220
Make sure you get plenty of rest.

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.360
O-Oh, yeah...

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:43.950
Before I collapsed... I...

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:44.790
Huh?

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.550
Th-There's so many of them...

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:00.590
It's like a cat party.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.850
Cats. Cats. Cats. 
Cats. Cats. Cats.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.850
<b>Agonizing Astronomy Club 
Investigation HQ</b>

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.360
<b>The possibility of the same suspect</b>

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.490
I've got no clue.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.170
What?!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:26.520
Let's just get some random fool,

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.280
and say they're the one that did it.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.030
What?!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.160
Huh?

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.540
We've found our girl!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.340
What?!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.460
What are you doing?!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.430
You came at a good time.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:51.680
Looks like I get to do something 
fun while I kill time!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.610
Now, spill it. I said, "spill it!"

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.400
What are you talking about?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.600
If you don't do as I say,

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:06.070
I can't guarantee what'll happen to her!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.850
Stop! It feels like my 
head's going to burst!

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.890
She's got nothing to do with this!

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.810
Isn't she your friend?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.790
How naive. What of it?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.630
Kanamori's getting hurt because of you.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.770
Can you live with yourself 
after that happens?

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.830
Save me!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.050
Someone...

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:37.060
Hey, come on! Someone save me!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.600
What are you going to do?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.270
Stop!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.540
Stop it!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.280
What are you doing?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.160
You'll confess your crimes.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.630
Fine.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.610
Very well...

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.150
<b>Student Council</b>

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.860
This girl is the perp?

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.100
It's true that it's 
suspicious for a girl

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.460
from another school to 
be loitering on campus...

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.980
Ban her permanently from the school—

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.880
that way she'll never be 
able to come in here again.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.490
Izumiko-chan, are you sure about this?

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.540
You're about to be deemed

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.620
as the person responsible 
for all of this.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.470
You're talking about the

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:56.350
rash of girls going 
unconscious, correct?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.110
Yeah. Apparently there have been

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.450
a number of victims appearing lately.

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:04.210
I see...

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.150
Well, if people think I'm the 
perpetrator, and that solves things,

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.690
then that's fine by me.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.010
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.200
Wait a second.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.190
Ooba-senpai!

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.450
Hasumi...

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.400
She's not the one responsible.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:21.980
She was officially invited to 
the Astronomy Club. She's a guest.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.330
A guest?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.880
Please look at this.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:33.630
<b>Todayama Izumiko has been granted 
entry privileges for the Astronomy Club 
-Oomori-sensei</b>

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.930
What the hell is this?!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.140
What's that?

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.140
When did someone make this?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.990
And since she is a guest,

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.940
it's the Astronomy Club's responsibility

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.850
to treat her cordially.

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.390
Damn it...

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.650
Why is that even being 
accepted as a real document?

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:53.430
What's that sound?

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.000
So I made it in time?

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.970
Wh-What's wrong?

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.370
Oomori-sensei is upset.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:09.960
Wh-What's going on?!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.370
She says that there is no way that

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.910
the Astronomy Club should be shut down!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.740
The teacher and her friends strongly

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.820
protest the student council 
on this course of action.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:24.730
Our advisor is the best.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.030
S-Stop it! I don't like cats...

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.570
All right, Hiromatsu!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.220
End this, and make sure no one 
actually figures out what happened!

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:36.990
Ready.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.380
CAT-MAX activate!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.410
Ready.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.380
Here I go!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.120
My fight to protect the 
Astronomy Club starts here!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:05.640
Go!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:33.430
<i>What a pure and beautiful light...</i>

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.010
<i>Julia...</i>

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:42.010
Iseda-senpai!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.080
It looks like she wasn't hurt.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.830
Cats are glorious.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.110
What's with that weird steam?

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.520
It's a form of coolant.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.850
<i>Something isn't right with my sister...</i>

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.010
On that note, who the heck is Julia?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.110
<i>and with the Astronomy Club.</i>

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:08.620
Anyway, it's a good thing we 
didn't get shut down again.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.890
Weren't we a bit too forceful?

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:12.720
It's fine.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.400
It's more fun when you break a promise,

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.960
than when you're making one.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.630
...at least that's what a 
scary-looking person said.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.080
When?

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.260
Yeah? What is it?

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.810
Uh... Todayama-senpai...

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.700
How long do I have to do this stakeout?

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.260
Oh, I forgot about that.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.440
C-Come on!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.120
You can go home now!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.380
I forgot about that...

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:33.970
Good work!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.570
What?!

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:36.770
Hey.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.820
How about saying something to her?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.380
It's better just to leave her be.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:45.330
But she's your sister, right?

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:48.240
It would have been 
better if she came here

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.250
under different terms.

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:53.570
Izumiko-san.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.000
Yes?

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.670
Please take this.

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:01.810
You've come to visit 
the Astronomy Club,

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:06.320
but you haven't seen any of 
the good parts of the club.

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.430
There are a lot of 
pretty stars in the sky.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:15.270
How about watching them with us?

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:31.050
No, this is how you use this.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.290
So you do know how it works.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.050
Of course I do.

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.950
Here. Use this.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.550
They're pretty.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.400
During autumn, 
the large Square of Pegasus

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.710
can be used to find other 
constellations in the sky.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.140
If you take the star near its zenith

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.830
on the eastern side of the Square, 
the constellation connected

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.480
off of it to the east is Andromeda.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.710
Huh? What's wrong?

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.580
Nothing really...

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:04.640
You can figure out the rest if you 
look at this reference chart.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.920
I'm surprised. She actually 
takes the club seriously.

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:19.920
Todayama is a genius.

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.410
You mean she used to be, right?

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.260
Hm, who knows?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.300
You can watch her every day,

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.060
and you still wouldn't understand her.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.170
She's like outer space itself.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.960
You can see the Daisy 
constellation over there.

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.080
Daisy?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:40.020
A long time ago, there were two 
sisters who were very close.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.500
But the older sister left

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.240
to find greater happiness, 
and because of that

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.990
she went far away.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.230
The younger sister believed 
in her, and waited for her.

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:51.040
But day after day, month after month, 
year after year, she didn't return.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:53.750
Eventually she turned into a daisy,

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:56.350
floated up towards the sky, 
and became a constellation.

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.150
Why are you telling me this?

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:01.050
It's a story Todayama made 
up about a constellation.

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>Daisy constellation?</i>

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.000
<i>What would make her 
tell a story like that?</i>

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:18.490
That star... What's it called?

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:25.900
The star sparkling dimly 
next to the Big Dipper.

00:22:26.980 --> 00:22:30.360
W-Wait, Izumiko-san. You can see it?

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:31.880
You can see that star?

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:33.980
I can.

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:35.160
Pretty clearly.

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:42.290
I wonder what its name is...

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:44.320
Alcor in Ursa Major...

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:46.550
Kind of a cute name.

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.480
<i>So she can see it, as well...</i>

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:53.150
<i>The other name for that star is</i>

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:55.550
<i>"The Death Omen."</i>

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:05.760
It appears that we were 
destined to fight, Izumiko.
